{
  "name": "Day 27 Solution: Advanced Workflow Patterns Review",
  "description": "Smaller demonstration workflow combining exactly 2 patterns (branching + filter/transform) plus a $now.diff() timing measurement, as scoped for a review day.",
  "tags": [
    "week-04",
    "day-27",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 27 Solution: Advanced Workflow Patterns Review\n\nA smaller demonstration combining exactly 2 patterns per the lesson's scope cap: Webhook -> fan out into 2 parallel branches (Day 22) -> merge/filter/transform with .filter()/.map() (Day 23) -> final Set measuring total_time with $now.diff() (Day 25). Credentials needed: None — jsonplaceholder.typicode.com covers the API branch.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_27_Advanced_Workflow_Patterns_Review.md.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook1",
      "name": "Review Demo Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        80,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "review-demo",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set1",
      "name": "Initialize Demo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        320,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "start_time",
              "value": "={{ $now }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "records",
              "value": "={{ $json.records || [{id:1,name:'Valid A',email:'a@test.com'},{id:2,name:'',email:''},{id:3,name:'Valid B',email:'b@test.com'}] }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http1",
      "name": "Branch 1: API Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set2",
      "name": "Branch 2: Local Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        560,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "local_data",
              "value": "={{ { id: 99, source: 'local' } }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set3",
      "name": "Combine Branches",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        800,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "combined",
              "value": "={{ { api: $('Branch 1: API Data').item.json, local: $('Branch 2: Local Data').item.json, records: $('Initialize Demo').item.json.records } }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set4",
      "name": "Filter and Transform Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1040,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "valid_records",
              "value": "={{ $json.combined.records.filter(r => r.name && r.email).map(r => ({ id: r.id, label: r.name.toUpperCase() })) }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "dropped_count",
              "value": "={{ $json.combined.records.length - $json.combined.records.filter(r => r.name && r.email).length }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set5",
      "name": "Measure Total Time",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1280,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "total_time",
              "value": "={{ $now.diff($('Initialize Demo').item.json.start_time, 'milliseconds') }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Review Demo Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Initialize Demo",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Initialize Demo": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Branch 1: API Data",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Branch 2: Local Data",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Branch 1: API Data": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Combine Branches",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Branch 2: Local Data": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Combine Branches",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Combine Branches": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter and Transform Records",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter and Transform Records": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Measure Total Time",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
